cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Pairs Trading with Honest Cost Modeling"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered, fully reproducible backtest of a cointegration-based
  pairs-trading strategy (EOG/FANG, 2021-2025) that reports gross and
  net-of-cost performance from the same frozen trades. Costs consume 78% of
  the gross P&L, the net result breaks even at 1.28x the assumed costs, and
  no candidate pair survives Holm correction for the 28 pairs searched.
